A||||2||Adrift||How to check if fuse is blown?||||1||
Z||000000||Adrift||11-04-2001||02:21 PM||||Can you visibly see if a fuse is blown? What does it look like?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Turkey on Rye||11-04-2001||02:25 PM||||Well it depends on what type of fuse it is. If its a fuse that plugs into your fuse box then you shoudl be able to see if its blowin fairly easy. It should look all burnt inside and the metal peice inside is broken. Hope i could help.||||reg||1
Z||000002||avengador1||11-04-2001||03:19 PM||||Sometimes you get a hairline split in the fuse that is hard to see. You would have to remove the fuse and check it for continuity with a volt meter to ensure it is working.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
